# Live daily RS/structural levels — regenerated each session by rs-levels.js (09:32 scrape)
# + compute_structural_levels.ts + compute_expected_move.js. These accumulate a per-day `days`
# map ON DISK (read live by the aggregator + backtests). They were tracked-but-edited-uncommitted,
# so a `git reset --hard`/`restore` silently wiped the day's levels (lost 06-24 + 06-25 on 06-25
# 11:29). Untracked = a reset can never touch them. Git history up to 4c3afa3 (06-23) is preserved.
daily_levels.json
daily_levels_es.json
daily_levels_cl.json
daily_levels_gc.json

# Regenerable research shadow DB (regime_gate scorer output)
data/regime_shadow.db
